  "steps": [
    "Cut beef into strips; marinate with baking soda, cornstarch, salt and soy sauce (see tenderising chapter). Cut potatoes into fries; toss with oil and salt. Bake at 200\u00b0C / 400\u00b0F for 30 minutes, flipping halfway.",
    "Chop all vegetables; grate garlic.",
    "Fry beef in a dry hot pan 60 seconds per side; remove. Add all vegetables except tomatoes; fry 7\u201310 minutes. Add garlic 15 seconds; add tomatoes, lid on, 3 minutes.",
    "Add soy sauce and beef; cook 1 more minute. Add cornstarch slurry if needed. Serve over potato fries. Top with cilantro."
